INTRO = "Rookie producer Baek Seung-chan is still racing across Seoul in a taxi when chief producer Kim Tae-ho bursts late into the cast dinner. Trying to boast that he defended the actresses in front of the director, Tae-ho accidentally lets the secret slip before Ra Joon-mo can stop him. Listen to the Korean first, then we'll go through it together."
OPENER = "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation."
